### 스토리 목록
GET http://localhost:4000/api/stories

### 스토리 올리기
POST http://localhost:4000/api/stories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "yuna"
}

### username 없이 올리기
POST http://localhost:4000/api/stories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isViewed": true
}

### 스토리 지우기
DELETE http://localhost:4000/api/stories/2

### 지운 뒤 목록
GET http://localhost:4000/api/stories
